sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Caller
    participant FA as Framework adapter<br/>(agent runtime: langgraph / raw / pydantic)
    participant GP as In-process GuardPipeline<br/>(defense-in-depth · tamper-evident)
    participant PX as Out-of-process chokepoint<br/>API Gateway -> bedrock_proxy Lambda<br/>(separate IAM identity · tamper-resistant)
    participant M as Model (Bedrock)
    participant DP as Data chokepoint<br/>data_proxy (FGAC, out-of-process)
    participant L as Audit ledger<br/>(DynamoDB, hash-chained)

    U->>FA: invoke(prompt)

    rect rgb(245,233,233)
    note over FA,GP: Agent trust domain - in-process (developer-owned)
    FA->>GP: before_model(text)
    GP->>GP: prompt-injection (B1) · credential (B2) · budget (B3)
    GP->>L: log decision
    GP-->>FA: ok (+ redact creds in place) — or raise GovernanceViolation
    end

    rect rgb(228,238,246)
    note over PX: Governing-team boundary - out-of-process (trust-but-verify)
    FA->>PX: POST /invoke · x-api-key · x-agent-type · x-nhi-id · no modelId
    PX->>PX: resolve policy from agent-controls.json (NHI-keyed · fail-closed)
    PX->>PX: EnforcementSession.check_input — re-run B1/B2/B3
    PX->>L: log decision
    Note right of PX: unknown NHI or block -> 403<br/>(holds even if the runtime is hostile)
    PX->>M: Converse (modelId injected server-side)
    M-->>PX: response (text + tool calls)
    PX->>PX: check_output — re-redact PII / credentials
    PX-->>FA: governed response
    end

    FA->>GP: after_model(response) — CoT/CoVe trace (H2)
    loop each tool call
        FA->>GP: before_tool(name, args) — capability (C1/H1) · blocked-pattern (C2)
        GP->>L: log decision
        FA->>DP: read via data_proxy
        DP->>DP: EnforcementSession + FGAC — mask columns / row-filter / deny
        DP->>L: log decision
        DP-->>FA: masked rows
    end
    FA-->>U: final answer
